,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_71","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_71","text":"Title: Feels like these guys won't last much longer","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_staranis_02","bgArt":"eventscene_staranis_02","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_72","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_72","text":"They keep messing up the same parts over and over. There's no way they don't know it. If anyone's aware of it, it's them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_73","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_73","text":"So if it's still not getting fixed, what does that tell you? They literally don't have time to practice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_74","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_74","text":"Apparently, all the staff bailed, so it's just the pop stars and their manager left. If one guy's handling their schedule while they're still performing, there's no way they've got any time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_75","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_75","text":"- Maybe they just blew up more than their team size can handle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_76","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_76","text":"- Calling it \"blew up\" might be a stretch, lol.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_77","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_77","text":"- Feels more like they just got way ahead of themselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_78","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_78","text":"- What a waste. They worked so hard and were actually fun to watch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_79","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_79","text":"- Seriously, why can't they get it together already? I've been rooting for them since day one, and now this? What a letdown.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"yoyo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_80","text":"That's rather petty. I expected you to be far more ruthless.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_staranis_yoyo","movie":null,"shown":["mustang_past","yoyo"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_81","text":"Petty? Don't be absurd. Let's just say it's all perfectly legal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"yoyo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_82","text":"Legal? If you say so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_83","text":"It would've been a shame to let good talent rot in some tiny agency, so I scouted them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_84","text":"Then I spotted a promising group of pop stars and asked a few of my connections to give them a little push.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_85","text":"If that's not perfectly legal, then what is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"yoyo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_86","text":"I hear the people you scouted are just doing menial work now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang_past","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_staranis1_04_s_87","text":"They should be perfectly satisfied. The pay's great, the benefits are generous, and the work's easy. What more could they ask for?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_staranis1_04_s_88","type":"Speech",